{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>They called it</b> — its name is Korot." "<b>Next to him</b> — like the expression איש על ידו לדגליהם (each man next to his standard), meaning 'on account of,' and likewise ובעבור יד הבונים; so-and-so supported their hand to build."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "Reading המה קרוהו as introducing the place name קרותיו (Korot); the Hebrew is terse and the identification is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:56.118121197Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}